:{"id":"q2Cem2PUR9s6","executionInfo":{"status":"aborted","timestamp":1787530634268,"user_tz":-600,"elapsed":121921,"user":{"displayName":"Wisnu Wibowo","userId":"15217971142000187842"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["xgb_model = Pipeline(steps=[\n","    ('preprocessor', preprocessor),\n","    ('classifier', xgb.XGBClassifier(eval_metric='logloss'))\n","])\n","\n","xgb_model.fit(X_train, y_train)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"sU5oaG8lH_R_"},"source":["This code builds and trains an XGBoost machine learning model for Titanic survival prediction. The pipeline automatically preprocesses the data before applying XGBClassifier, which is a powerful gradient boosting algorithm known for high prediction performance. The parameter eval_metric='logloss' is used to evaluate classification error during training. The model learns patterns from the training data (X_train, y_train) and becomes ready to predict survival outcomes on new data."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"7O2HHb0GBu9a"},"source":["Loss function of Model Comparison"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"osYssaPG6U5D","executionInfo":{"status":"aborted","timestamp":1787530634270,"user_tz":-600,"elapsed":121917,"user":{"displayName":"Wisnu Wibowo","userId":"15217971142000187842"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["from sklearn.linear_model import SGDClassifier\n","from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\n","from sklearn.metrics import log_loss\n","import xgboost as xgb\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import pandas as pd\n","from sklearn.neural_network import MLPClassifier\n","\n","#\n","X_train_preprocessed = preprocessor.fit_transform(X_train)\n","X_test_preprocessed = preprocessor.transform(X_test)\n","\n","#Logistic Regression Loss Curve\n","sgd_log_model = SGDClassifier(\n","    loss='log_loss',\n","    learning_rate='constant',\n","    eta0=0.01,\n","    max_iter=1,\n","    warm_start=True,\n","    random_state=42\n",")\n","logistric_val_losses = []\n",